Update 1.68 is online now! You'll find loads of new additions and improvements, including:

- the new divine dimension, Osamosa, where you'll encounter four new zones with four new monster families, as well as a host of new dungeons and resources;
- level 215 implemented in the game;
- the Feca class revamp;
improvements to - the Enchantment system;
- and the new Eliocalypse quest.

The list of all changes is available here.

So join us on the game servers now to check out Update 1.68: Osamosa!
